flowchart TD
    UseCases["用例层(LoginUseCase/GetPlayerUseCase等)"] -->|协调| DomainModel["领域模型"]

    subgraph DomainModel["领域模型"]
        AggregateRoot["聚合根(Player/User/Post等)"] -->|包含| Entity["实体(UserId/PlayerId/PostId等)"]
        AggregateRoot -->|包含| ValueObject["值对象(PlayerProps/UserProps/PostContent等)"]
        AggregateRoot -->|发布| DomainEvent["领域事件(UserCreated/UserLoggedIn等)"]
    end

    DomainModel -->|调用| Repository["存储库接口(PlayerRepository/UserRepository等)"]
    Repository -->|实现| Infrastructure["基础设施层"]

    subgraph UseCases
        LoginUseCase["登录用例"]
        GetPlayerUseCase["获取玩家数据用例"]
        CreatePostUseCase["创建帖子用例"]
    end

    subgraph AggregateRoot
        UserAggregate["User聚合根"]
        PlayerAggregate["Player聚合根"]
        PostAggregate["Post聚合根"]
    end

    subgraph DomainEvent
        UserCreated["UserCreated事件"]
        UserLoggedIn["UserLoggedIn事件"]
        PostCreated["PostCreated事件"]
    end
